# GitHub returns 404 for /stargazers to logged-out clients (it is gated behind
# sign-in), so the link checker cannot verify it even though it resolves fine
# in a browser. Verify with: curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' \
#   https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/stargazers  ->  404
https://github.com/.*/stargazers
